{"4116790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bloodrune", "steam_appid": 4116790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The miserable failure of a human being Marina lives an empty and aimless life. That is, until a strange being reaches out to her in her dreams, claiming she can help Marina escape her troubles. Will you take her hand? Are you ready to do what it takes? Dive into Marina's depressing life and do your best to save her from what lurk in the shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A purpose for your sad little life!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different mini-games!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrible decisions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple ways to end the story!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ritual sacrifice!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gardening!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of ways to die!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And lots of walking!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116790/extras/59bf5e829166e43bcdfed14c79f01b39.avif?t=1786132951\" width=777 height=111 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The miserable failure of a human being Marina lives an empty and aimless life. That is, until a strange being reaches out to her in her dreams, claiming she can help Marina escape her troubles. Will you take her hand? Are you ready to do what it takes? Dive into Marina's depressing life and do your best to save her from what lurk in the shadows.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A purpose for your sad little life!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Many different mini-games!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Terrible decisions!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple ways to end the story!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ritual sacrifice!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gardening!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of ways to die!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And lots of walking!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116790/extras/59bf5e829166e43bcdfed14c79f01b39.avif?t=1786132951\" width=777 height=111 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Bloodrune is an adventure game where you walk and talk your way in and out of various terrible scenarios. Plunge into Marina's depressing life and do your best to save her from what lurks in the shadows.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116790/2b1af0c95d8c957e2f9a1d44903fa3d5ce46055b/header.jpg?t=1786132951", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116790/5f21e61eb2f6c5401e1664f8b49ceebeecc7f548/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786132951", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116790/5f21e61eb2f6c5401e1664f8b49ceebeecc7f548/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786132951", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 or later<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo E6320 (2*1866) or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce 7600 GS (512 MB) or equivalent</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Kyanite Heart"], "publishers": ["Kyanite Heart"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single